    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoking Gun</strong> is a single player, western themed, vertical scroller,  shoot 'em up arcade game. As a unaffiliated spiritual successor to a classic 1990's arcade game, <strong>Smoking Gun</strong> carries on the old gaming style testing your reflexes and accuracy with a new story and modern game engine.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/c21cfd15fdf202a5821cf1db223f3f9a.poster.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/c21cfd15fdf202a5821cf1db223f3f9a.webm?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/c21cfd15fdf202a5821cf1db223f3f9a.mp4?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find and collect gold, ammunition, and power-ups to aid your fight for justice!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/fbdfb9376d86f63ccc403453ae085a8e.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=127 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new weapons and upgrade your guns to your heart's desire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be challenged like in retro games of old. Progression saves are limited and the bandits are unforgiving!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight unique bosses and enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy clean, beautiful western landscapes and visual effects created in the powerful Unreal Engine 5!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to satisfying sound effects and high quality western music!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/cc80fd997c4dd30de8d17c49a0105243.poster.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/cc80fd997c4dd30de8d17c49a0105243.webm?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/cc80fd997c4dd30de8d17c49a0105243.mp4?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backstory</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the mysterious disappearances of members from the notorious Red Rock Raiders gang, the outlaws are hell-bent on vengeance with their sights set on taking Hickstown hostage. As cries for help echo through the Red Rock Valley, the renowned Arizona Ranger, armed with his trusty big iron, rides in to untangle the dire situation confronting the Sheriff and his deputies. Little does he realize the depth and darkness of the abyss that awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/b17582bcc5af7d20b27a22ae33da8321.poster.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/b17582bcc5af7d20b27a22ae33da8321.webm?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/b17582bcc5af7d20b27a22ae33da8321.mp4?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smoking Gun</strong> is a single player, western themed, vertical scroller,  shoot 'em up arcade game. As a unaffiliated spiritual successor to a classic 1990's arcade game, <strong>Smoking Gun</strong> carries on the old gaming style testing your reflexes and accuracy with a new story and modern game engine.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/c21cfd15fdf202a5821cf1db223f3f9a.poster.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/c21cfd15fdf202a5821cf1db223f3f9a.webm?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/c21cfd15fdf202a5821cf1db223f3f9a.mp4?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find and collect gold, ammunition, and power-ups to aid your fight for justice!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/fbdfb9376d86f63ccc403453ae085a8e.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=127 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock new weapons and upgrade your guns to your heart's desire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be challenged like in retro games of old. Progression saves are limited and the bandits are unforgiving!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight unique bosses and enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enjoy clean, beautiful western landscapes and visual effects created in the powerful Unreal Engine 5!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to satisfying sound effects and high quality western music!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/cc80fd997c4dd30de8d17c49a0105243.poster.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/cc80fd997c4dd30de8d17c49a0105243.webm?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/cc80fd997c4dd30de8d17c49a0105243.mp4?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backstory</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the mysterious disappearances of members from the notorious Red Rock Raiders gang, the outlaws are hell-bent on vengeance with their sights set on taking Hickstown hostage. As cries for help echo through the Red Rock Valley, the renowned Arizona Ranger, armed with his trusty big iron, rides in to untangle the dire situation confronting the Sheriff and his deputies. Little does he realize the depth and darkness of the abyss that awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/b17582bcc5af7d20b27a22ae33da8321.poster.avif?t=1749502124\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/b17582bcc5af7d20b27a22ae33da8321.webm?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984340/extras/b17582bcc5af7d20b27a22ae33da8321.mp4?t=1749502124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
